WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.900
The nominees for performance
 by an actress in a leading role

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.600
are Jane Fonda in 
The Morning After.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:12.766
Sissy Spacek

00:00:12.766 --> 00:00:14.866
in Crimes of the Heart. 

00:00:17.166 --> 00:00:21.100
Kathleen Turner in 
Peggy Sue Got Married.

00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:23.000
Marlee Matlin 

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.700
in Children of a Lesser God. 

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.533
Sigourney Weaver in Alien.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.600
And the winner is, 

00:00:41.366 --> 00:00:43.100
Marlee Matlin. 

00:01:28.166 --> 00:01:29.300
I am. 

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.766
I just want to
 thank a lot of people.

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:36.233
To tell you the truth,
 I didn't

00:01:36.233 --> 00:01:40.100
prepare for this speech,
 but I definitely want to thank

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.533
the Academy and its members.

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:45.766
And I want to thank 

00:01:45.766 --> 00:01:48.833
all those special people
 in the film 

00:01:48.833 --> 00:01:51.400
and I can name them
 Randa Haines, Patrick Palmer,

00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:54.866
the entire cast and crew, 

00:01:54.866 --> 00:01:58.600
and particularly William Hurt
 for his great support

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:02.600
and love in this film. 

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:03.566
And I want to thank

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:07.233
my mother and father, 

00:02:07.566 --> 00:02:11.466
Eric, Marc, Gloria, 
Zachary and Liz.

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:14.433
They're here tonight with me. 

00:02:15.333 --> 00:02:17.166
And I just want to thank
all of you. 

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.600
I love you.

